## Action Checklist: Pre-Seed Technical Governance

Follow this CTO checklist to validate technical competence before signing contracts or granting cap table equity:

1. **Retain Absolute IP Ownership**: Ensure all contractor and advisory agreements explicitly assign all software intellectual property to your Delaware C-Corp.
2. **Enforce Clean Database Boundaries**: Mandate isolated schema migrations and RLS policies on all customer-facing tables.
